  "result": {
    "text": "def derivative(xs: list):\n    \"\"\" xs represent coefficients of a polynomial in variable x.\n    xs[0] + xs[1] * x + xs[2] * x^2 + ...\n    Return derivative of this polynomial's derivative in the same form.\n    >>> derivative([3, 1, 2, 4, 5])\n    [1, 4, 12, 20]\n    >>> derivative([1, 2, 3])\n    [2, 6]\n    \"\"\"\n    return [2 * i * i] + in xs]\n\n# Example usage\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import doctest\n    doctest.testmod()",
